      },
      {
        "title_card": "把自己送进4强",
        "kicker": "印第安维尔斯 · 半决赛",
        "seconds": 7.26,
        "narration": "三月，她在印第安维尔斯打进4强。半决赛，对面是世界第一萨巴伦卡。",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "iw-sf",
        "start": 260.72,
        "end": 285.7,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "frame": "court",
        "track": false,
        "fit": "crop",
        "narration": "",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 5.82,
            "end": 8.24,
            "text": "For the third time in her career,\n这是她生涯第三次，"
          },
          {
            "at": 8.24,
            "end": 11.64,
            "text": "Aryna Sabalenka is in the Indian Wells final.\n萨巴伦卡打进印第安维尔斯决赛。"
          },
          {
            "at": 14.3,
            "end": 16.46,
            "text": "And she's done it in back-to-back years.\n而且连续两年做到。"
          },
          {
            "at": 16.46,
            "end": 20.08,
            "text": "Still yet to drop a set in this tournament.\n本届比赛，她仍未丢一盘。"
          },
          {
            "at": 20.76,
            "end": 22.76,
            "text": "Another emphatic performance,\n又一场强势的表现，"
          },
          {
            "at": 22.76,
            "end": 24.7,
            "text": "full of power and precision.\n充满力量与精准。"
          }
        ],
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/noskova-finals-2026/context-iw-sf.png",
          "kind": "story_text",
          "corner": "tr",
          "width": 0.6,
          "pad": 0.043,
          "show_after": 18.18,
          "show_for": 3.2,
          "motion": "editorial",
          "label": {
            "topic": "止步4强·390分",
            "date": "2026.03.13",
            "place": "印第安维尔斯半决赛",
            "people": "诺斯科娃 vs 萨巴伦卡",
            "score": "3-6 4-6"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title_card": "抢七跨过高芙",
        "kicker": "马德里 · 1/8决赛",
        "seconds": 7.95,
        "narration": "迈阿密首战失利，斯图加特打进8强。马德里，她抢七击败高芙，晋级8强。",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "madrid-r16",
        "start": 261.12,
        "end": 296.04,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "frame": "court",
        "track": false,
        "fit": "crop",
        "narration": "",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 7.82,
            "end": 9.54,
            "text": "Put it in the books.\n记下这一胜。"
          },
          {
            "at": 9.54,
            "end": 11.82,
            "text": "A dozen top-ten wins\n第十二次击败世界前十，"
          },
          {
            "at": 11.82,
            "end": 15.56,
            "text": "earns the 21-year-old from Czechia a spot\n让二十一岁的捷克姑娘，"
          },
          {
            "at": 15.56,
            "end": 17.88,
            "text": "in her 21st WTA quarterfinal,\n第21次进入巡回赛8强，"
          },
          {
            "at": 17.88,
            "end": 19.78,
            "text": "and her first in Madrid.\n这也是她首进马德里8强。"
          },
          {
            "at": 21.22,
            "end": 22.58,
            "text": "as Linda Noskova knocks off\n诺斯科娃击败了"
          },
          {
            "at": 22.58,
            "end": 24.18,
            "text": "last year's runner-up Coco Gauff,\n去年的亚军高芙，"
          },
          {
            "at": 24.18,
            "end": 26.68,
            "text": "in three dynamic sets,\n三盘激战之后，"
          },
          {
            "at": 26.68,
            "end": 29.52,
            "text": "holding on to her one-set lead\n她守住先赢一盘的优势，"
          },
          {
            "at": 29.52,
            "end": 34.88,
            "text": "to move through, 6-4, 1-6, 7-6.\n以6比4、1比6、7比6晋级。"
          }
        ],
        "inset": {
          "image": "assets/reel/noskova-finals-2026/context-madrid-r16.png",
