      },
      {
        "title_card": "法网，首轮止步",
        "kicker": "红土赛季",
        "seconds": 10.26,
        "narration": "随后，她负于科斯秋克，止步马德里8强，罗马止步第四轮。法网首轮，又以五比七、六比七负于萨卡里。",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "title_card": "草地带来本季首冠",
        "kicker": "柏林 · 决赛",
        "seconds": 9.22,
        "narration": "二十六天后，故事转向草地。柏林决赛，她三盘击败佩古拉，拿到本季首冠，也是生涯第二冠。",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "source": "berlin-final",
        "start": 5977.8,
        "end": 6029.65,
        "cx": 0.5,
        "frame": "court",
        "track": false,
        "fit": "crop",
        "narration": "",
        "voice": {
          "rate": "+6%",
          "pitch": "+0Hz"
        },
        "quote": [
          {
            "at": 9.28,
            "end": 12.94,
            "text": "A spectacular week in Berlin\n精彩绝伦的柏林一周，"
          },
          {
            "at": 12.94,
            "end": 17.38,
            "text": "ends with tears of joy for Linda Noskova.\n以诺斯科娃喜极而泣收尾。"
          },
          {
            "at": 18.96,
            "end": 20.08,
            "text": "It's been a bit of a wait\n这场等待，有些漫长，"
          },
          {
            "at": 20.08,
            "end": 21.78,
            "text": "for her second career title,\n她的生涯第二冠终于到来，"
          },
          {
            "at": 21.78,
            "end": 24.66,
            "text": "but she gets it on the grass in Germany\n她在德国的草地上夺冠，"
          },
          {
            "at": 24.66,
            "end": 28.04,
            "text": "at the expense of the former champion Jessica Pegula.\n击败的是前冠军佩古拉。"
          },
          {
            "at": 28.04,
            "end": 30.34,
            "text": "Another classic between these two.\n两人又奉献了一场经典。"
          },
          {
            "at": 30.34,
            "end": 33.74,
            "text": "But in the end, it's the serve and first-strike tennis\n最终，是发球和第一拍进攻，"
          },
          {
            "at": 33.74,
            "end": 36.34,
            "text": "of Linda Noskova that gets her home.\n让诺斯科娃笑到最后。"
          },
          {
            "at": 37.8,
            "end": 40.38,
            "text": "What a relief she will feel,\n她一定会感到如释重负，"
          },
          {
            "at": 40.38,
            "end": 45.96,
